    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbe <i>Canada Clash</i> \u2013 a <strong>fast-paced memory game</strong> wrapped in a <strong>neo-retro VHS aesthetic!</strong> Test your brain, challenge your reflexes, and immerse yourself in an endless sequence of levels inspired by the chaotic energy of retro politics and broadcast glitches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcfa <strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Endless memory challenges</strong> \u2013 the more you play, the harder it gets!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf9e\ufe0f <strong>VHS-style visuals</strong> \u2013 scanlines, glitches, and CRT noise for full immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Fast-paced gameplay</strong> \u2013 memorize, match, and beat your high score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0a <strong>Retro sound design</strong> \u2013 classic 80s synths &amp; distorted TV static.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How long can you keep up with the clash?</strong></p>",
